# Practice script. Run with: python3 implementation.py practice.dml
load demo
schema
# 1. Direct access, then walk a ring.
find CUSTOMER Acme
get
walk CUST-ORDERS
# 2. Cross from a product, through an item, up to the order and customer.
find PRODUCT WIDGET
find first PRODUCT-ITEMS
find owner ORDER-ITEMS
find owner CUST-ORDERS
currency
# 3. Resume the product walk where you left it.
find next PRODUCT-ITEMS
# 4. Before and after.
compare WIDGET
compare BOLT
